  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help keep the Ukrainian refugee center safe.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be used to protect the refugee center as long as Ukrainian refugees who are tired of the war, feel safe. At least 100 to 3,000 people will be beneficiary. The center, which was built by cleaning and repairing the space that had been abandoned for 9 years, had collapsed the ceiling and water and electricity are in trouble one after another. Even the interest of other donors has disappeared, and the manpower that helped clean up has over, and staffs are exhausted. Give your help!</narrative>
  </description>
